# Silver Scrutiny ({X}{U}{U} Sorcery) has "CastWithFlash | ValidSA$ Spell.XCostLE3":
# the cast may begin out of timing, and X is checked once announced
# (StaticAbilityCastWithFlash.anyWithFlashNeedsInfo). X=2 is 3 or less: it is cast
# on the opponent's turn and draws two.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 U
tapformana ai 3 U
tapformana ai 4 U
tapformana ai 5 U
queue payx 2
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
castspell ai 6
resolvestack
